---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Contact from '../components/Contact.astro';
import { physicsInterests, background } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout
  title="Physics — Ikechukwu Emmanuel Isaac (Justice Thinker), BSc Physics, FUTO, Nigeria"
  description="Ikechukwu Emmanuel Isaac (Justice Thinker), Full-Stack & AI Engineer in Nigeria, holds a BSc in Physics from FUTO (2025) with a thesis on wireless energy transmission."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="label label--ember">Physics</p>
      <h1>Model first. Then argue from the data.</h1>
      <p>I trained as a physicist. It still shapes how I build software.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="degree-title">
    <div class="wrap split light">
      <div>
        <p class="label label--ember">Degree</p>
        <h2 id="degree-title" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.25rem);margin-top:1rem">{background.degree}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt>School</dt><dd>Federal University of Technology Owerri (FUTO)</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Year</dt><dd>2025</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Thesis</dt><dd>Wireless energy transmission</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>The idea is old and still striking: a changing field in one place can do work somewhere else, with nothing in between. That thesis is why there's a field drawn behind my photo on the home page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="interests-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section__head">
        <p class="label label--ember">Interests</p>
        <h2 id="interests-title">The parts of physics I keep coming back to.</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="rules">
        {physicsInterests.map((p, i) => (
          <li>
            <span class="label label--ember">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <h3>{p.name}</h3>
            <p>{p.body}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Contact />
</Layout>
